text = "I'm thinking of adding an upgrade system for my Bella.
One of them will be here. Maybe.
What kind of upgrades?
Health, John Wick reloading animations, Doom Guy punches.
Your ideas are welcomed.
You'd be able to refuse all those upgrades if you want.
More optional exploration is needed anyway."

